r finding out  that they're taking the stone  suddenly jewelry awakens a hidden power  that can freeze those who can move in  stasis by expelling their spectre a  lifeform that grants those with the  ability to move in stasis jury uses the  power to take back the stone and escape  meanwhile a handler comes to kill a  cultist who is about to murder a man  while the majima orders her men to  capture jury alive makoto gets a specter  and is able to move in stasis and he  goes around being curious about the  still world jewry and grandfather are  pursued by cult members who are fully  aware of the latter's teleportation  ability but the two managed to get away  they were together in the middle of the  road so they could have time to react  should they get spotted by the cult  however a cult member posing as one of  the stored humans launches a surprise  attack on jewry the cult member is  intercepted by grandfather and jury  expels his spectre to freeze him  grandfather recalls the time he became  aware of jury's ability as 17 years ago  jury invertedly used the same power on  him and was nearly frozen from it later  the two pursued more cultists and unable  to teleport away from them jury uses her  power to make them motionless the two  head to the hideout to get tsubasa and  makoto but find them missing unaware  that they'd escaped as a result of being  given specters meanwhile a handler kills  one of the cultists for attempting to  kill a motionless person in front of  majima and she sees it collapse majima  finds out that a handler called a herald  by the cult has a dead corpse inside it  seventeen years ago majima and her  family entered the stasis able to move  her brother and parents all became  handlers while she encountered jury who  expelled her specter to save her from  becoming a handler this made her join  the cult that she could get jury to use  that power again that could bring her  family back  jury and grandfather arriving jury uses  her power in front of majima later jury  with her grandfather rescues takafumi  but he's hesitant to go with them  meanwhile the cult decides to try and  murder a motionless man with various  degree of intent to determine the  threshold for when a handler takes  action the handler appears majima sees  that it's her mother that's inside it  along the way jury warned subasa and  makoto not to stay at the house having  written a note but after those two  arrived at home occultists had removed  the letter and attacks the two knowing  that handlers don't take action against  those killing a moving person tsumasa  takes on the cultists and tells makoto  to run during the fight he gets stabbed  but fortunately the wound isn't deadly  and he manages to defeat the cultist and  escape shortly afterwards he starts to  transform into a handler jury arrives  just in time to expel his spectre before  his transformation is complete and  tsubasa becomes motionless jury's father  expresses his displeasure for being  rescued claiming that he was trying to  be a spy makoto is kidnapped by majima's  partner and majima approaches jury  asking her to use her power on the  handler which jury agrees to do despite  disapproving of her actions majima tries  to kill a motionless man to draw the  handler but her murderous intent was too  weak to draw it out after jury's father  quietly builds up the murderous intent  the handler arrives to kill him but  fortunately the grandfather uses his  teleportation ability to save him as the  handler is trying to kill jury's father  she jumps on the monster and after a  long struggle she expels the specters  thus saving her father after handler  collapses the corpses of majima's family  come out majima expressed her gratitude  towards her dead parents for recognizing  her for a moment however her brother is  still alive  having resolved majima's conflict jury  decides to destroy the stone as soon as  they exit stasis after learning about  the tragedy that befell the majima  family but without dakafumi knowing  about the plan to do that jury must  expel the specters from all cult members  still able to move in stasis with majima  and her partner cutting ties with the  cult to help her out meanwhile cult  leader sagawa explains that the stasis  power is tied to bloodlines while  telling his disciples that he intends to  harness the power of stasis to live as  long as he can leading to a moral divide  within the cult while majima and her  partner are talking to a cult member  jury and grandfather teleport to their  location and she expels the specter out  of one of the cult members while two of  the cult members find the stone that was  hidden on a tree and informed sagawa in  his final sermon sagawatt tells his  disciples that he's mastered the power  of the handlers sagawa transforms into a  handler but unlike the other handlers he  harnesses its powers while maintaining a  full control of his body sagawa then  starts killing his disciples one of the  disciples attempts to kill subasa but  jury arrives and expels his spectre  sagawa tries to kill jury but  grandfather teleports her out of danger  majima approaches sagawa's most loyal  disciple shiomi trying to help jury's  cause but he declines out of fear for  his safety mindy might encounter sagawa  again and she gets cornered and then  jewelry and grandfather arrive to save  her xiaomi arrives and slash his  grandfather's hand to collect his blood  she only puts a drop of his blood in the  stone and grandfather experiences great  pain as he's about to become motionless  with his last bit of strength before  becoming one of the stalled grandfather  teleports with jury to the stone's  location jewelry smashes the stone to  stop grandfather from becoming  motionless but by doing so the means of  existing stasis is gone sagawa attacks  and due to the stone being destroyed  xiomi decides to betray sagawa and help  jury and grandfather escape majima  mentions that there is another way to  leave the stasis by expelling everybody  specters but jewry would remain trapped  in stasis xiaomi tells everybody what  sagawa's goal is to see the world far  into the future and because he's killing  people to achieve this goal that he's  got to be stopped meanwhile a handler  attacks takafumi but makoto is able to  stop it as he awakens his power to  communicate with handlers jewelry and  company arrive at the scene and the  handler is revealed to be one of the  cult members that sagar killed after his  final sermon everybody realizes now that  they have the handlers fighting on their  side with everybody mistakenly thinking  that takafumi and not makoto controls  the handler that he takes advantage of  the situation to clear his name  jury and company launch an attack on  sagawa using the handler to distract him  while jury expels his spectre but is  unable to do so however sagavar exhausts  his power and loses his human form and  retreats jewelry and grandfather track  him down at the house where sagomar  proposes a way for everybody to make it  out of stasis but jewry is highly  skeptical sagawa explains his backstory  as he was a shinto priest training to  succeed his father and had lived a  sheltered life he didn't have many  friends but he had a close friend one  day the two of them caught sagawa's  father and his friend's mother having a  sexual affair which led to sagawa  condemning his father and eventually led  to the creation of the genuine love  society sagawa concludes his backstory  saying that he found out about the  stasis stone when his father died five  years after the incident after hearing  his story jury goes through her intended  course of action by expelling his  specter but her power has no effect on  him so she tries to kill him instead not  wanting julie to be burdened by killing  someone her grandfather attempts to kill  him but he's still too weak to do it  suddenly jury's father appears and kills  sagawa his body dissolves leaving only  his brain then his brain flies out to  the window and shoots out threads all  over the place that cuts takafumi's  fingers while he was trying to reach the  brain jury expels taka forming spectra  to prevent blood loss while they're  observing the threads the brain turns  into a strange shape looking like a star  and xiaomi figures out that they're used  for nourishment and are made of specters  later jury uses her powers to remove the  specter from her brother to remove him  from stasis meanwhile sagawa's threads  are slowly spreading having majima  trapped among them jury cuts the threads  to save manjima leading to sagavar  starving to death afterwards sagawa is  reborn as a baby  confident that sagawa's memories will  not return jury decides to raise him as  her son she sends all remaining  inhabitants out of stasis except sagawa  and grandfather she intends to raise him  in the stasis until he's mature enough  to handle himself in the real world  after helping jury raise sagawa for a  while grandfather is sent out of stasis  leaving just jewry and sagawa after half  a year passes in stasis sagawa is sent  back as time passes in the stasis for  jury she begins to break down mentally  and begins her transformation into a  handler however she was saved when she  has a chance encounter with the wife of  the stone's creator that died in 1880  the creator's wife who's the original  founder of the stasis returns jury to  the real world and reunites her with her  family years later since that fateful  day sagawa has grown up and treasures  his new family  so this is it for today's video if you  like the video give it a huge thumbs up  and subscribe to the channel for more  videos farewell till next time

